IMAGE DATASETS ARE NOT COVERED AND ARE NOT REDISTRIBUTED
--------------------------------------------------------
None of the 14 image datasets used in this study are contained in this
repository or in its release assets. Each carries its own licence and access
terms, and must be obtained from its original source: CIFAR-10, CIFAR-100,
ciFAIR-100, STL-10, Tiny-ImageNet, EuroSAT, DTD, Food-101, PathMNIST
(MedMNIST v2), CUB-200-2011, ImageNet64 (downsampled ImageNet) and
ImageNet-100 (an ImageNet subset; ImageNet's own terms apply).

What we release instead are the committed SUBSET INDICES: the exact per-class
image indices each experimental cell consumed. Combined with
scripts/make_subsets.py, they reproduce the precise image selection from a
user's own copy of each dataset, without redistributing any image.
